# Only admin-functions, its workspace dependencies, and the two CLI packages the workspace root
# links reach the image. Anything else in the context invalidates the build cache without changing
# the image (#114).
#
# Excluding the contents rather than the directory is deliberate: the matcher will not descend into
# an excluded directory, so a re-include under one is silently ignored. Every package keeps its
# manifest because pnpm reads all workspace members named in the lockfile.
packages/*/**
!packages/*/package.json
!packages/admin-functions/**
!packages/calendar-sync/**
!packages/clubspot-sdk/**
!packages/commodore/**
!packages/gsuite/**
!packages/todo-manager/**

# Repo tooling the image never runs.
.claude/
.github/
docs/
scripts/
flake.nix
flake.lock
justfile

# Recreated inside the image. The bare names match the repo root only, so match every depth.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
*.md

# Live credentials — must never enter the build context.
.gcloud/
.env*
